{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nA read-only page for GitHub Actions: workflow runs, their jobs and steps, and the job log — via `gh run …`, reusing the GitHub page's plumbing (background fetch, disk cache, `o` to open in the browser).\n\n## Non-goals\n- Read-only, like every vig page: the view inspects, it never mutates (no start/stop/kill/apply/switch). No rerun / cancel.\n\n## Sub-issues\n- #99 — Actions: page skeleton\n- #100 — Actions: runs pane\n- #101 — Actions: jobs pane\n- #102 — Actions: log pane\n\n(suggested order: skeleton → runs → jobs → log)\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:37Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":98,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Actions view"}
